# History pane: drag the scrollbar, then the horizontal wheel and Shift+wheel pan a graph that has
# sixteen lanes. The first snapshot uses the history fixture for the scrollbar.
fixture lanes
wait text "merge: lan"
snapshot top
wheel right 60 20 4
snapshot wheel-right
wheel left 60 20 2
snapshot wheel-left
wheel down 60 20 4 shift
snapshot shift-wheel-down
wheel up 60 20 2 shift
snapshot shift-wheel-up
